The '''Scorpion Foil''' grants a {{stat|dmg|+250%}} bonus to and {{Stat|combat wisdom|+30}} against {{mt|Arthropod}} mobs. Its {{AN|Webcutter}} ability also allows the '''Scorpion Foil''' to break webs left by the {{MobSprite|Tarantula Broodfather}}'s {{AN|Web of Lies}} ability.

